    verification writePathCensusRowsHaveARefusalBehindThemImplementGate : Test { :>> id = "1b9bbc91-039d-4f14-bb79-f80307f4644d"; :>> title = "Sprint 701 implement gate"; :>> createdAt = "2026-09-13"; :>> createdBy = "claudeFable5"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::test; :>> procedureText = "RAN: grep ledger_refused( keel-cli/src/main.rs -> 5 call sites (2904, 2980 literal verbs; 4909, 4914, 4920 verb variable); grep control .keel/metrics/hooks.jsonl refused -> accept:no-quote 4, append-gate-result:ran-receipt 3, append-result:ran-receipt 2, reject:no-quote 1 - reject had no census row; python rows.py -> 11 census rows, 8 live. python patch_registry.py -> patched write.rs, census.rs, main.rs; python patch_registry2.py -> reject x3 in the registry, reject rows x3 in the census (every anchor asserted once). cargo test --release --lib -- write_path_registry_tests:: census::tests:: control_structure::tests::human_authority -> 13 passed 0 failed. PROBE 1 (entry append-gate-result:ran-receipt removed): every_live_row_has_a_refusal_and_every_refusal_a_row FAILED naming [append-gate-result:ran-receipt]; every_ledgered_refusal_in_main_is_registered FAILED naming main.rs:2989: append-gate-result:ran-receipt; reverted. PROBE 2 (row append-result:fictional added): the census test FAILED naming [append-result:fictional]; reverted. Real tree after revert: 4 passed 0 failed, git diff --stat 3 files 173 insertions 1 deletion as before the probes. cargo clippy --release -p keel-cli --all-targets -- -D warnings -> exit 101 (cmd_record 103/100 lines from the new arm; option_if_let_else in the registry test); python patch_registry3.py -> refused_injected_prose helper beside ledger_refused, both arms one line, map_or_else; clippy again -> exit 0; the four tests 4 passed 0 failed; cargo build --release -> Finished, exit 0; copied to target/release/keel-serve.exe; git diff --stat 3 files 175 insertions 1 deletion."; }
